# F3 Nation — Project Guidelines

This repository uses the **`AGENTS.md` standard** as the single source of truth.
Read these before making changes:

1. [AGENTS.md](mdc:AGENTS.md) — canonical repository conventions (structure,
   build & test commands, environment setup, coding style, commit conventions).
2. [docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md](mdc:docs/AI_DEVELOPMENT_GUIDE.md) — secure
   patterns, pitfalls, and a pre-flight checklist for every change.
3. The relevant per-app guide, e.g. [apps/me/AGENTS.md](mdc:apps/me/AGENTS.md)
   or [apps/auth/AGENTS.md](mdc:apps/auth/AGENTS.md).

If asked to **audit** the repo and file issues, follow
[docs/AI_AUDIT_PLAYBOOK.md](mdc:docs/AI_AUDIT_PLAYBOOK.md).

Project-specific Cursor skills live under `.cursor/skills/`.
